# Google / Gmail OAuth — OPTIONAL override
#
# The app already ships with a default OAuth client, so Google sign-in works
# without any configuration here. These variables only let a fork use its OWN
# Google client instead of the shipped default.
#
# To use your own: create an OAuth client of type "Desktop app" in the Google
# Cloud Console (APIs & Services → Credentials), enable the Gmail API, then copy
# this file to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in the values below.
#
# No redirect URI needs to be registered — a dynamic loopback address
# (http://127.0.0.1:<random-port>) is used, which the "Desktop app" type allows.
#GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
#GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
